/// A point of type `Lnc`, computed from `p`, `q` and `t`:
///
/// ```text
/// x = q.x + t * (p.x - q.x)
/// y = q.y + t * (p.y - q.y)
/// z = q.z + t * (p.z - q.z)
/// where 0 <= t, t <= 1
/// ```
///
/// The constructors compute the coordinates in `f64` with a bound on the error
/// of each one, [`Point::approx`] and [`Point::err`]; [`Point::exact`] computes
/// them exactly.
